<title>USA: Kansas City Southern completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Kansas City Southern completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kansas City Southern Industries Inc said Monday it has acquired Gateway Western and Eastern Railways, extending its rail network an additional 402 miles between Kansas City, Missouri, and East St. Louis, Illinois.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In 1996, Gateway reported earnings of $5.1 million on revenues of $40.9 million.</p>
<p>Kansas City Southern shares closed up 3/4 at 53-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
